            <ArticleTitle>Structure and dynamics elucidation of ionic liquids using multidimensional Laplace NMR.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>11056-11059</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1039/c7cc05493a</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We demonstrate the ability of multidimensional Laplace NMR (LNMR), comprising relaxation and diffusion experiments, to reveal essential information about microscopic phase structures and dynamics of ionic liquids that is not observable using conventional NMR spectroscopy or other techniques.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
